  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Integrated Framework (EIF) Trust Fund 2025-2031</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Enhanced Integrated Framework Trust Fund (EIF) Phase Three. EIF&#x2019;s purpose is, through a unique global partnership, to support LDCs to use trade as a tool for economic growth and poverty reduction. EIF empowers LDCs to identify where trade can form an integral part of national development strategies and assists them to leverage Aid for Trade (AfT).</narrative>
  </description>
